* {{nihongo|{{ill|Shitateruhime|ja|下照比売|lt=Shitateruhime-no-Mikoto|simple|User:Immanuelle/Shitateruhime|fr|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Shitateruhime|qq=}}|下照姫命|}}
